# Go coverage profile (build artifact)
coverage-go.out

# Helm chart Secret/ExternalSecret templates contain no actual secret
# material -- only template syntax; real values come from Vault/External
# Secrets Operator or --set at install time (never committed). The blanket
# *secret* rule above exists to keep real credential files out of the repo,
# not to block legitimate chart templates named secret.yaml/
# externalsecret.yaml -- this is a scoped exception, not a weakening of it.
!k8s/helm/**/templates/*secret*.yaml
